sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant CMD as TicketCommandService
  participant NA as TicketNumberAllocator
  participant TS as TicketService
  participant WF as WorkflowEngine
  participant DB as Database
  C->>GW: POST /api/v1/tickets with Idempotency-Key
  GW->>CMD: forward after edge JWT check, core re-verifies
  CMD->>DB: look up key for tenant, user, key
  alt key already stored
    CMD-->>C: replay stored 201, or 409 DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION if body differs
  else new key
    CMD->>NA: next number
    NA->>DB: atomic UPDATE ticket_counter in its own short transaction
    CMD->>TS: create inside one business transaction
    TS->>DB: read cached SLA policy and tenant calendar
    TS->>WF: apply active workflow rules
    WF-->>TS: actions: set priority, add tag, assign least loaded
    TS->>DB: insert ticket, attachments, activity, outbox ticket.created, audit
    CMD->>DB: insert idempotency_key in the same transaction
    CMD-->>C: 201 Created, SLA due dates set
  end
